From: gamenative <dev@localhost>
Date: Wed, 24 Sep 2026 09:20:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH gamescope] A9: honor GAMESCOPE_PNP_IDS_PATH for the PNP IDs
 file

HWDATA_PNP_IDS is a build-time prefix path (build-host termux prefix) that
does not exist on device. The GameNative payload ships pnp.ids under
filesDir/gamescope/share/hwdata/; the launcher exports GAMESCOPE_PNP_IDS_PATH.
Fall back to the compiled path when unset. Cosmetic only (monitor names).
---
 src/Backends/DRMBackend.cpp | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/Backends/DRMBackend.cpp b/src/Backends/DRMBackend.cpp
--- a/src/Backends/DRMBackend.cpp
+++ b/src/Backends/DRMBackend.cpp
@@ -1208,6 +1208,8 @@ void load_pnps(void)
 {
 #ifdef HWDATA_PNP_IDS
-	const char *filename = HWDATA_PNP_IDS;
+	const char *filename = getenv( "GAMESCOPE_PNP_IDS_PATH" );
+	if ( !filename || !*filename )
+		filename = HWDATA_PNP_IDS;
 	FILE *f = fopen(filename, "r");
 	if (!f) {
 		drm_log.infof("failed to open PNP IDs file at '%s'", filename);
-- 
2.51.1
